template_source: ".agent/workflow/scribe-engineering-local-causal-retrieval/templates/scribe.master-template.yaml"
notes:
  - "SCRIBE initialized from a legacy-missing template situation, then migrated to the portable local causal retrieval bundle."
  - "Only causal memory belongs here; structural facts belong to Graphify when graphify-out is available."
