    l0_abstract: "Repaid DEBT-003 by migrating auth to HttpOnly cookie sessions with refresh rotation, CSRF, and origin enforcement."
    pourquoi: "The clean-architecture migration intentionally isolated auth storage first; the next production step was to stop trusting browser JavaScript with bearer secrets while preserving the existing direct REST and Socket.IO topology. The chosen cookie-backed boundary keeps compatibility, limits refresh-token replay through family revocation, and lets the frontend hydrate session state without localStorage or Redux token exposure."
    validations:
      - "npx prisma generate passed after adding RefreshToken schema and migration."
      - "backend npm run build passed."
      - "frontend npx next typegen passed."
      - "frontend npm run lint passed."
